<p>You know how to hit the right places, gaining <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+6%, +12%, +17%, +21%, +24%</acronym> critical damage modifier and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 10, 13, 17, 20</acronym> armour penetration.</p>